ss=\"slide\">\n    <h1>Cidofovir</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"diamond\">❖</span>Uses:</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>CMV-induced retinitis in patients with AIDS</li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section adverse\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"diamond\">❖</span>Adverse effects:</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Dose related kidney damage</li>\n          <li>Neutropenia, metabolic acidosis, uveitis and ocular<br>hypotony also occur</li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        <div class=\"red-bullet\">•</div>\n        <div class=\"note-text\"><span class=\"note-label\">Note:</span> Probenecid must be coadministered with cidofovir to<br>reduce the risk of nephrotoxicity, but probenecid itself<br>causes rash, headache, fever, and nausea</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <section class=\"section contra\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"diamond\">❖</span>Contraindications:</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Patients with preexisting renal impairment</li>\n          <li>Patients taking concurrent nephrotoxic drugs, including<br>NSAIDS</li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
